ad/t_thumb/sc10dyj.jpg"}, {"id": 1697708, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc10dyk.jpg"}, {"id": 1697709, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc10dyl.jpg"}, {"id": 1697710, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc10dym.jpg"}], "slug": "koutetsu-reiiki-steeldom", "storyline": "In the aftermath of a great supernatual war, one of the few forms of entertainment is a fighting tournament between users of \"Ryoga\", a mystical power that manifest souls as a suit of mechanized battle armor. Eight warriors enter the tournament; some seek fame and fortune, some seek a better life, and some simply fight for the thrill.", "summary": "Koutetsu Reiiki: Steeldom (also known as just \"Steeldom\") is a third-person arena-based action game and a follow-up to Reverthion by the same developers. It plays very similarly to Sega's Virtual On, and includes eight playable characters each with their own unique moveset and abilities. There is a single-player campaign with unique endings for each character, as well as a 2-player split screen versus mode; the Saturn version adds system link support for two-player matches between two consoles.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 18, "name": "Science fiction"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/koutetsu-reiiki-steeldom", "videos": [{"id": 168241, "name": "Gameplay Video", "video_id": "G7b_-ShUaDw", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=G7b_-ShUaDw", "title": "\u92fc\u9244\u970a\u57df\u3000\u30b9\u30c6\u30a3\u30fc\u30eb\u30c0\u30e0 (Koutetsu Reiiki: Steeldom). [PlayStation - TechnoSoft]. (1996). Misaki & Kiria Plays.", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/G7b_-ShUaDw/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}